{
  "title": "FSx · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "기존 애플리케이션이 요구하는 파일 시스템을 관리형으로 제공합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>FSx</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#guide-1\">애플리케이션에 맞는 제품</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#guide-2\">운영 요구 확인하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>26 / 62</span></div><h1>FSx</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Amazon FSx는 <strong>특정 파일 시스템의 기능과 호환성이 필요한 애플리케이션을 위한 관리형 파일 스토리지</strong>입니다. Windows 파일 공유나 고성능 병렬 처리처럼 요구가 뚜렷할 때 선택합니다.</p><p>사용 중인 애플리케이션의 파일 접근 방식과 운영 환경을 먼저 확인한 뒤 그에 맞는 FSx 제품을 선택합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"comparison\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"fsx-for-windows-file-server\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"windows-single-az-and-multi-az\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"fsx-for-lustre\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"scratch-and-persistent\"></span><h2>애플리케이션에 맞는 제품</h2><p><strong>FSx for Windows File Server</strong>는 SMB 파일 공유와 Active Directory 연동이 필요한 Windows 환경에 적합합니다.</p><p><strong>FSx for Lustre</strong>는 많은 서버가 대량의 데이터를 병렬로 읽고 쓰는 계산 작업에 적합합니다. S3 데이터와 연계하는 분석 환경에서도 사용할 수 있습니다.</p><p><strong>FSx for NetApp ONTAP·OpenZFS</strong>는 각 파일 시스템의 관리 기능이나 기존 환경과의 호환성이 필요할 때 검토합니다. 지원 프로토콜과 데이터 관리 기능을 요구에 맞춰 비교합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"data-repository-associations\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"fsx-for-netapp-ontap\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"ontap-tiering-and-replication\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"fsx-for-openzfs\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"backup-and-network-access\"></span><h2>운영 요구 확인하기</h2><p>제품별로 단일 AZ·다중 AZ 배치, 처리량, 백업, 접근 제어와 지원 기능이 다릅니다. 파일 시스템 이름만으로 고가용성 구성이 결정되는 것은 아닙니다.</p><p>Windows 계정 기반 권한에는 Active Directory<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup> 연동을, 병렬 계산에는 필요한 처리량과 데이터 적재 시간을 먼저 확인합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>파일 시스템을 고르는 기준</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ul class=\"concept-flow concept-comparison\"><li><strong>Windows 공유</strong><span>Windows File Server</span></li><li><strong>병렬 고성능 처리</strong><span>Lustre</span></li><li><strong>기존 기능 호환</strong><span>ONTAP·OpenZFS</span></li></ul><p class=\"diagram-note\">어떤 애플리케이션이 어떤 파일 시스템 기능을 요구하는지부터 확인합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>Windows 애플리케이션이 사내 도메인 계정으로 공유 폴더에 접근해야 합니다. FSx for Windows File Server를 선택하고 Active Directory와 연결합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>Active Directory</strong> — 사용자·컴퓨터·그룹의 신원과 권한을 관리하는 Microsoft 디렉터리 서비스입니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/WindowsGuide/what-is.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is FSx for Windows File Server? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/LustreGuide/what-is.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon FSx for Lustre? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/ONTAPGuide/what-is-fsx-ontap.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon FSx for NetApp ONTAP? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-4\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/OpenZFSGuide/what-is-fsx.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon FSx for OpenZFS? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q048/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q048\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q048\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q048</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q048/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which managed file system supports SMB shares and Windows ACLs for Windows servers?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q048\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q048\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q048\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q048\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx for Windows File Server</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-windows-file-server\">FSx for Windows File Server</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a>와 Windows 파일 기능에 맞는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q049\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q049\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q049</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q049/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An on-premises application expects an SMB file share, while new files must be stored as objects in S3. Which service is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q049\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q049\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An RDS read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q049\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 File Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q049\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS gp3</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">File Gateway</a>가 온프레미스 파일 인터페이스와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 객체 저장을 연결한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">Storage Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,4\" data-question=\"Q086\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q086\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q086</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q086/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An on-premises Windows file application must retain an SMB interface while storing data in AWS. Which TWO services are candidates?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q086\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx for Windows File Server</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q086\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only Amazon EFS over NFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q086\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot as a file share</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q086\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only Route 53 Resolver</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q086\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 File Gateway</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, E</strong> · 관리형 Windows 파일 시스템에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 객체로 이어지는 하이브리드 파일 인터페이스에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">File Gateway</a>가 맞는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">Storage Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q050\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q050\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q050</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q050/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company repeatedly transfers data from an on-premises NAS to EFS and S3 over the network and synchronizes changes. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q050\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q050\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Snow Family only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q050\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q050\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DataSync</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#aws-datasync\">DataSync</a>는 온라인 데이터 전송·동기화를 자동화한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q040\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q040\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q040</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q040/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web application stores image files by key and serves them over HTTP. Which service should it consider first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q040\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q040\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q040\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon S3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q040\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>는 객체 저장과 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 접근에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">이전 용어 <b>EventBridge</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">다음 용어 <b>Global Accelerator</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
